WEBVTT

00:27.840 --> 00:28.440
<b>Minato Kai</b>

00:48.150 --> 00:51.100
I-It's starting.

00:51.460 --> 00:58.040
Heave-ho, here we go! 
Bring on the war! Bucchigiri!

02:38.260 --> 02:43.230
<b>#06 Much Much Friendship! "Nira-Reba"-lution 21!</b>

02:45.500 --> 02:49.110
<i>I remember how it started way back then.</i>

02:52.260 --> 02:54.240
Hey, isn't that them?

02:54.240 --> 02:57.450
The guys who dominated every middle 
school in Honki City. The God Kings!

02:57.770 --> 02:59.660
So, which one will you join?

02:59.660 --> 03:01.440
Which what?

03:01.440 --> 03:04.710
Minato Kai or Ikki Union, dude. Come on.

03:05.220 --> 03:07.710
I'd be bored in either one.

03:10.560 --> 03:11.920
Hurry!

03:13.410 --> 03:15.520
That hurt, you little shit!

03:16.380 --> 03:17.380
Huh?

03:19.260 --> 03:21.570
Are you guys the God Kings?

03:22.310 --> 03:24.650
You might've been hotshots in middle school,

03:24.650 --> 03:26.690
but things are different here!

03:36.600 --> 03:37.910
<i>Marito, man...</i>

03:38.230 --> 03:42.570
<i>Ever since we got to the top in middle 
school, he's seemed totally burned out.</i>

03:43.370 --> 03:48.350
<i>There's got to be someone here 
who can light his fire again.</i>

03:54.760 --> 03:57.130
You've got to join Ikki Union!

03:57.930 --> 03:58.830
Huh?

03:58.830 --> 04:01.640
Outa! Munchies!

04:02.540 --> 04:03.760
Hurry up, hurry up!

04:03.760 --> 04:05.770
Where are we going?

04:05.770 --> 04:09.090
Our leader and the head 
of Minato are facing off!

04:09.900 --> 04:11.770
Damn! It's already starting!

04:11.770 --> 04:16.030
Ikki
Union

04:12.780 --> 04:16.030
I'm the leader of Ikki Union, Shiba Ransei.

04:16.030 --> 04:20.410
Minato Kai

04:16.500 --> 04:20.410
Doman Kenichiro. Today I will take you down!

04:42.140 --> 04:44.640
<b>Minato Kai</b>

04:42.150 --> 04:44.640
This means Minato rules now!

04:44.640 --> 04:46.310
Wow!

04:46.770 --> 04:48.020
Marito?

05:10.070 --> 05:12.560
Like that, just like that!

05:12.560 --> 05:14.580
Let's go, old man!

05:15.000 --> 05:16.000
Huh?

05:16.930 --> 05:17.960
Hey!

05:20.820 --> 05:23.720
What's his problem?

05:24.600 --> 05:26.600
<b>Delicious As Always!!</b>

05:26.950 --> 05:29.850
Shiba-san lost and is 
graduating from the group.

05:30.200 --> 05:33.350
And we're definitely no match for Doman.

05:33.350 --> 05:34.600
We're begging you.

05:34.970 --> 05:37.360
Become the new leader of Ikki!

05:37.360 --> 05:41.280
Why wouldn't that old guy face me?

05:41.280 --> 05:44.930
Doman only fights against dudes 
who have strong convictions.

05:44.930 --> 05:47.060
Like fighting for honor, 
or for friendship and stuff.

05:47.060 --> 05:49.500
But if you become the leader of Ikki, 
he'll definitely take you on!

05:49.500 --> 05:50.960
So please! Okay?

05:50.960 --> 05:54.300
Ugh, pain in the ass.

05:56.130 --> 05:58.130
<b>Mi</b>

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Spirit

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Family

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Fire

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Determination

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Soul

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Friendship

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Admiration

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Participation

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Opportunity

05:58.130 --> 06:03.130
Calm

06:00.090 --> 06:01.170
What the hell?

06:01.170 --> 06:02.280
Who do you think you are?

06:05.840 --> 06:07.670
I'm Tahide Outa.

06:07.670 --> 06:10.770
I'm taking over as the leader 
of Ikki, starting today.

06:11.490 --> 06:14.040
I challenge you to a fight!

06:20.820 --> 06:22.600
Doman got challenged!

06:22.600 --> 06:25.330
His opponent is one of those God Kings!

06:49.920 --> 06:51.070
Outa!

06:54.030 --> 06:57.860
It's up to you, Marito.

06:59.280 --> 07:01.410
This stinks, Outa.

07:01.410 --> 07:04.810
You trying to work the 
old guy up to fight me?

07:04.810 --> 07:06.740
I can see right through you.

07:07.580 --> 07:10.990
Conviction has nothing to do with this.

07:11.390 --> 07:13.500
The only thing I want is...

07:15.290 --> 07:17.290
some excitement!

07:29.110 --> 07:30.820
He kicked Ken-san?!

07:33.930 --> 07:35.730
Ken-san just...

07:35.730 --> 07:37.060
...laughed!

07:44.130 --> 07:46.750
<i>He's back to his old self again!</i>

07:48.540 --> 07:51.280
<i>They continued fighting after that,</i>

07:51.910 --> 07:54.950
<b>Graduation
Ceremony</b>

07:52.290 --> 07:54.950
<i>but never determined a winner.</i>

07:56.780 --> 07:59.160
Hey! Is Doman seriously repeating a ye—

08:08.090 --> 08:10.580
<i>Doman is waiting.</i>

08:12.720 --> 08:16.600
<i>For the day that Marito 
can finally defeat him.</i>

08:27.540 --> 08:29.630
Big Brother, please stop it!

08:29.940 --> 08:31.930
Mahoro-chan, it's too dangerous here!

08:31.930 --> 08:33.480
Then go and stop them!

08:33.480 --> 08:34.490
Okay! Sure!

08:35.190 --> 08:39.620
So, hey. Wanna call it, guys? 
NG is here, too...

08:44.570 --> 08:48.510
This is so much fun, Kenichiro.

08:49.770 --> 08:52.260
This will finally settle it.

08:54.910 --> 08:56.220
Brother!

09:27.460 --> 09:30.140
Brother! Brother!

09:31.840 --> 09:34.340
Hang in there, please!

09:34.340 --> 09:35.410
Ken-san!

09:35.570 --> 09:36.850
Ken-san!

09:37.840 --> 09:40.590
Um, Mahoro-chan,

09:40.590 --> 09:42.930
should I call an ambulance?

09:44.130 --> 09:46.570
I am through with you.

09:52.290 --> 09:54.400
Go finish them off.

09:55.460 --> 09:59.490
Wimp out on me and you're off to prison.

10:03.830 --> 10:06.580
The NG guys are here!

10:06.580 --> 10:09.340
What a cheap move! Those wimps!

10:09.340 --> 10:11.200
This is for Zabu!

10:11.200 --> 10:12.800
Yo, I'm not dead!

10:13.510 --> 10:17.050
<i>We get into the action here, 
our merge rate goes up, and then...</i>

10:17.400 --> 10:18.860
<i>Ichiya and I...</i>

10:19.680 --> 10:21.590
Yeah. Let's go, man!

10:21.590 --> 10:22.730
Wait! Hey!

10:22.730 --> 10:26.390
Where do you think you're going? 
What was all of that training for?

10:26.390 --> 10:29.540
There's a huge battle going on right now!

10:32.360 --> 10:35.610
Training and fighting 
don't mean anything now.

10:35.610 --> 10:40.180
You mean... you really only did it 
to make that girl like you?

10:40.180 --> 10:42.600
What other reason is there?

10:42.600 --> 10:44.120
There's a damn good one!

10:45.340 --> 10:49.910
Your friends are fighting 
for their lives right now!

10:50.750 --> 10:52.970
You gonna turn your back on them and run?

10:56.010 --> 10:59.200
Those aren't my friends. 
They aren't anything to me!

11:00.380 --> 11:03.830
<i>So he didn't have it in him after all.</i>

11:10.520 --> 11:12.720
Been looking for you, AJ.

11:14.200 --> 11:17.540
Or rather... He's there, isn't he?

11:17.900 --> 11:19.030
Senya.

11:19.650 --> 11:21.300
<i>How did he...</i>

11:22.120 --> 11:25.700
<i>You mean this guy isn't an imaginary friend?</i>

11:31.870 --> 11:32.800
Ara-chan!

11:33.830 --> 11:38.200
Come on. You'd better merge 
if you don't wanna die.

11:38.200 --> 11:42.810
Do it now, with Senya. Come on, come on!

11:45.180 --> 11:48.650
Hey! Let's merge! He really will kill you!

11:49.890 --> 11:54.190
But what... reason... 
do I even have to live?

11:55.360 --> 11:56.620
Ara-chan!

12:05.290 --> 12:08.290
Murder them! Murder them! Murder them!

12:08.610 --> 12:09.970
Murder them!

12:13.250 --> 12:17.920
He's totally weak. You sure 
you were right about this?

12:24.310 --> 12:27.810
Oh, come now. What are you 
dragging your feet for?

12:28.280 --> 12:32.020
Nothing ever gets done without me, does it?

12:32.410 --> 12:38.020
It's time for all the fools who mocked 
me to face their executioner.

12:39.530 --> 12:41.990
So you were behind all this.

12:42.390 --> 12:45.240
That's right! It was all me!

12:45.680 --> 12:48.710
And you idiots destroyed each other for me!

12:48.710 --> 12:50.030
So really,

12:50.030 --> 12:52.480
thank you.

12:54.100 --> 12:55.670
Asshole!

12:55.670 --> 12:59.520
Go to hell!

13:03.110 --> 13:04.010
Komao!

13:04.520 --> 13:07.640
I will never forgive you for this!

13:08.130 --> 13:10.640
Hi, sad little Zabu-kun!

13:10.640 --> 13:12.650
You piece of shit!

13:17.270 --> 13:20.530
This is annoying, 
so I'll take you all on at once.

13:22.130 --> 13:23.370
Come on.

13:23.370 --> 13:25.030
Quit screwing with us!

13:28.380 --> 13:29.910
Got you!

13:49.430 --> 13:52.100
Shindo!

14:01.030 --> 14:02.990
Oh, ouch.

14:25.530 --> 14:28.180
Hey! Are you really okay with this?

14:28.180 --> 14:30.460
Turning your back on your friend?

14:35.360 --> 14:39.190
<i>Just a little more, just one more step...</i>

14:39.190 --> 14:41.810
<i>and I could have reached him!</i>

14:56.420 --> 14:57.460
Shit.

14:57.460 --> 14:59.710
Now you've stained my shoe.

15:03.950 --> 15:05.480
All right, then.

15:06.650 --> 15:09.220
I'll get to work on your bodies

15:09.220 --> 15:12.110
to make sure they never fight again!

15:13.610 --> 15:14.570
Huh?

15:19.060 --> 15:20.680
You're kind of in my way.

15:21.150 --> 15:24.020
You can disappear. Creep.

15:33.730 --> 15:36.020
Mahoro-chan?

15:36.830 --> 15:38.800
You keep out of this.

15:38.800 --> 15:43.000
There isn't a single thing left 
that you can do here.

15:47.700 --> 15:49.480
<i>Don't do it, Mahoro-chan!</i>

15:49.960 --> 15:51.000
<i>Run.</i>

15:51.680 --> 15:54.900
Run!

15:56.800 --> 16:00.440
Run? Why would I run?

16:01.690 --> 16:04.190
You don't scare me at all.

16:04.500 --> 16:05.960
You're just some rando.

16:07.510 --> 16:11.540
You don't even know who you are 
until other people tell you.

16:12.150 --> 16:13.700
You're an empty shell.

16:19.410 --> 16:21.180
You're literally nothing.

16:25.100 --> 16:26.590
You die.

16:48.550 --> 16:49.900
What's this now?

16:50.250 --> 16:52.820
Don't be a fool. Give it up!

17:01.790 --> 17:03.500
<i>Our merge rate</i>

17:04.030 --> 17:05.630
<i>is going up?</i>

17:05.630 --> 17:06.760
You're pathetic!

17:08.420 --> 17:09.420
Ara-chan!

17:12.930 --> 17:15.930
Don't push your luck with me, boy!

17:22.980 --> 17:26.080
<i>How high could it possibly go?</i>

17:34.620 --> 17:36.530
I'm tired of your shit!

17:41.250 --> 17:42.370
Get him.

17:46.840 --> 17:48.140
Get him.

17:51.670 --> 17:52.800
Get him!

17:57.180 --> 17:59.520
Get him!

17:59.520 --> 18:05.530
To lose my virginity!

18:40.560 --> 18:42.370
Yeah!

18:42.370 --> 18:43.810
He did it!

18:46.050 --> 18:48.310
<i>He faced an opponent possessed by Ichiya</i>

18:48.800 --> 18:50.530
<i>and managed to beat him?!</i>

18:52.550 --> 18:53.570
Mahoro-chan!

18:54.210 --> 18:55.200
You okay?

18:59.460 --> 19:01.420
Ara-pyon!

18:59.460 --> 19:01.420
Ara-jin!

19:02.000 --> 19:03.800
That was insane, Ara-pyon!

19:03.800 --> 19:05.250
That was beautiful!

19:05.250 --> 19:06.650
I wanna fight you next!

19:06.650 --> 19:07.460
No, I'm next!

19:07.460 --> 19:08.500
Not a chance!

19:07.940 --> 19:09.350
Big Brother!

19:11.960 --> 19:14.760
I thought I told you not to come.

19:15.680 --> 19:17.000
Ken-san!

19:25.490 --> 19:26.510
Ara-chan.

19:31.150 --> 19:33.750
I always believed in you.

19:34.410 --> 19:37.130
I knew you would do the right thing!

19:40.230 --> 19:42.830
I'm not the one who didn't give up, though.

19:42.830 --> 19:44.040
Huh?

19:44.040 --> 19:45.910
Forget it.

19:55.470 --> 19:56.760
Let's go home.

19:58.930 --> 20:00.010
Yeah!

20:06.390 --> 20:09.400
<b>Chu~ Chu~ Chinese Restaurant 
Open for business</b>

20:06.790 --> 20:09.090
Ramen, chili shrimps, pepper steak,

20:09.090 --> 20:11.650
leek and liver, and Chu 
Chu gyoza! For you chu!

20:11.650 --> 20:13.010
Yahoo!

20:11.650 --> 20:16.900
<b>Chu~ Chu~
Chinese Restaurant</b>

20:13.010 --> 20:14.440
This looks so good!

20:14.440 --> 20:16.900
Eat up and get big and strong!

20:17.320 --> 20:19.160
I'm back.

20:20.130 --> 20:21.410
Arajin?!

20:21.410 --> 20:22.920
What this time? A fight?

20:22.920 --> 20:25.080
Oh, my! Oh, youth!

20:25.080 --> 20:26.410
Old hag!

20:27.320 --> 20:29.270
Ouch!

20:29.270 --> 20:30.790
It stings!

20:30.790 --> 20:31.940
Arajin.

20:31.940 --> 20:32.670
Huh?

20:33.170 --> 20:35.800
You've got a pretty nice punch there, man.

20:36.270 --> 20:37.640
I was wrong about you.

20:37.980 --> 20:40.430
Huh? What does that mean?

20:40.920 --> 20:45.060
All I care about is capturing 
Mahoro-chan's heart.

20:45.780 --> 20:48.310
I still don't get it, though. 
That Shindo guy...

20:48.310 --> 20:50.670
How did he know about you?

20:50.670 --> 20:55.100
Wh-Who knows? He probably 
heard you say my name.

20:57.010 --> 20:59.580
Ouch!

21:00.440 --> 21:01.700
<i>The time</i>

21:02.290 --> 21:04.140
<i>has finally come!</i>

22:40.800 --> 22:45.050
<b>Ikki Union</b>

22:40.800 --> 22:45.050
Ikki Union

22:41.140 --> 22:45.050
Damn it! Next time, I'll get him for sure.

22:45.050 --> 22:48.420
So, will you agree to become Ikki's leader?

22:48.420 --> 22:49.560
Ikki?

22:49.560 --> 22:51.570
It sounds too lame. No way.

22:51.570 --> 22:53.060
Come on!

22:53.980 --> 22:55.310
But Siguma...

22:56.000 --> 22:57.290
What's that?

22:57.290 --> 22:58.060
Oh!

22:58.060 --> 23:02.320
Ik

22:58.060 --> 23:02.320
ki

22:58.060 --> 23:02.320
Single

22:58.060 --> 23:02.320
Mind

22:58.930 --> 23:01.340
Single mind?

23:01.340 --> 23:02.320
Shorten that to...

23:02.320 --> 23:03.610
Siguma!

23:04.490 --> 23:06.260
That sounds so cool!

23:06.260 --> 23:08.120
Yeah, that's the one.

23:08.120 --> 23:10.370
<b>Seafood
Gratin Macaroni</b>

23:12.040 --> 23:14.740
Man, you gotta quit losing.

23:14.740 --> 23:16.250
I didn't lose.

23:23.270 --> 23:24.430
Outa.

23:25.810 --> 23:28.530
Next time, I swear...

23:35.800 --> 23:37.670
I'll get the jumbo size.

23:39.260 --> 23:40.310
Sure.

23:45.030 --> 23:50.610
<b>Revival!</b>

23:45.030 --> 23:50.610
<b>Tonight is BUCCHI Back to the Chinese Food!</b>

23:45.420 --> 23:48.170
Next week is chu-per Bucchigiri!
